ttps://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587#pullrequestreview-2935400503","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-17T12:10:18Z"},{"id":2935436656,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6u9zVw","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?u=2b8b17ce969861380874563b333a546e0bbaab56&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","login":"lawnjelly","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587#pullrequestreview-2935436656","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-17T12:22:24Z"},{"id":2935443049,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6u905p","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?u=2b8b17ce969861380874563b333a546e0bbaab56&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","login":"lawnjelly","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly"},"body":"Looks fine to me, but this will need a check by @akien-mga .","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587#pullrequestreview-2935443049","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-17T12:24:28Z"},{"id":2939946543,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6vPAYv","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"When suggesting `__COUNTER__` for assertion reuse, this is what I was referring to:\r\n```cpp\r\n// typedefs.h\r\n\r\ntemplate <typename T, int Counter, typename = void>\r\nstruct is_fully_defined : std::false_type {};\r\n\r\ntemplate <typename T, int Counter>\r\nstruct is_fully_defined<T, Counter, std::void_t<decltype(sizeof(T))>> : std::true_type {};\r\n\r\ntemplate <typename T, int Counter>\r\nconstexpr bool is_fully_defined_v = is_fully_defined<T, Counter>::value;\r\n\r\n#if !defined(SCU_BUILD_ENABLED) && !defined(DEV_ENABLED) && !defined(DEBUG_ENABLED)\r\n/// Enforces the requirement that a class is not fully defined.\r\n/// This can be used to reduce include coupling and keep compile times low.\r\n/// The check must be made at the top of the corresponding .cpp file of a header.\r\n#define STATIC_ASSERT_INCOMPLETE_CLASS(m_type) \\\r\n\tclass m_type;                              \\\r\n\tstatic_assert(!is_fully_defined_v<m_type, __COUNTER__>, #m_type \" was unexpectedly fully defined. Please check the include hierarchy of '\" __FILE__ \"' and remove includes that resolve the class.\");\r\n#else\r\n#define STATIC_ASSERT_INCOMPLETE_CLASS(m_type)\r\n#endif\r\n\r\n...\r\n// ustring.cpp\r\n\r\n#include \"ustring.h\"\r\n\r\nSTATIC_ASSERT_INCOMPLETE_CLASS(Dictionary); // Expectation: pass.\r\n// Old: !is_fully_defined_v<Dictionary>. Passes.\r\n// New: !is_fully_defined_v<Dictionary, 0>. Passes.\r\n\r\n#include \"core/variant/dictionary.h\"\r\n\r\nSTATIC_ASSERT_INCOMPLETE_CLASS(Dictionary); // Expectation: fail.\r\n// Old: !is_fully_defined_v<Dictionary>. Reuses previous template. Passes.\r\n// New: !is_fully_defined_v<Dictionary, 1>. Distinct template. Fails.\r\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587#pullrequestreview-2939946543","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-06-18T16:53:23Z"},{"id":2945143994,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6vi1S6","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587#pullrequestreview-2945143994","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-20T09:06:53Z"},{"id":2945154094,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6vi3wu","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587#pullrequestreview-2945154094","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-20T09:09:42Z"},{"id":2967628449,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6w4mqh","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"712bc9966880c414631d338199978d3051d9b6e3","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587#pullrequestreview-2967628449","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-06-27T18:53:43Z"},{"id":3291246853,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7ELHEF","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"712bc9966880c414631d338199978d3051d9b6e3","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"I appreciate the effort, reducing cross-includes is really important to bring down our compile times.\r\n\r\nI'm a bit concerned about how many of these asserts we'll have to put everywhere to get good results, but I don't really have a better solution in mind.\r\n\r\nCould use a rebase before merging, just to be somewhat up-to-date with `master`.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587#pullrequestreview-3291246853","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-01T21:43:55Z"}]